ation","ex":"Wear appropriate clothing for the interview.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w23","w":"arbitrary","pos":"adj","tr":"произвольный","def":"based on chance, not reason","ex":"The choice seemed completely arbitrary.","topic":"academic","lvl":3},{"id":"w24","w":"assert","pos":"v","tr":"утверждать","def":"to state something firmly","ex":"She asserted her right to speak.","topic":"academic","lvl":3},{"id":"w25","w":"assess","pos":"v","tr":"оценивать","def":"to judge the quality or amount of something","ex":"Teachers assess students through exams.","topic":"education","lvl":1},{"id":"w26","w":"assume","pos":"v","tr":"предполагать","def":"to accept something as true without proof","ex":"I assumed the shop would be open.","topic":"academic","lvl":1},{"id":"w27","w":"attain","pos":"v","tr":"достигать","def":"to succeed in getting something","ex":"She attained the highest score in her class.","topic":"education","lvl":3},{"id":"w28","w":"attribute","pos":"v","tr":"приписывать","def":"to say that something is caused by something","ex":"He attributed his success to hard work.","topic":"academic","lvl":3},{"id":"w29","w":"authentic","pos":"adj","tr":"подлинный","def":"real and not copied","ex":"The museum displays authentic Roman coins.","topic":"culture","lvl":2},{"id":"w30","w":"bias","pos":"n","tr":"предвзятость","def":"an unfair preference for one side","ex":"The article showed a clear bias.","topic":"society","lvl":2},{"id":"w31","w":"brief","pos":"adj","tr":"краткий","def":"short in time or length","ex":"She gave a brief summary.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w32","w":"capacity","pos":"n","tr":"вместимость; способность","def":"the maximum amount something can hold or do","ex":"The stadium has a capacity of 50,000.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w33","w":"catastrophe","pos":"n","tr":"катастрофа","def":"a sudden event causing great damage","ex":"The flood was a catastrophe for the town.","topic":"environment","lvl":3},{"id":"w34","w":"circumstance","po