 exactly","ex":"Scientists determined the cause of the fire.","topic":"academic","lvl":1},{"id":"w70","w":"distinct","pos":"adj","tr":"отчётливый, отдельный","def":"clearly different or separate","ex":"There are three distinct groups.","topic":"academic","lvl":2},{"id":"w71","w":"distribute","pos":"v","tr":"распространять","def":"to give out to a number of people","ex":"Food was distributed to the villagers.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w72","w":"diverse","pos":"adj","tr":"разнообразный","def":"made up of many different kinds","ex":"London has a diverse population.","topic":"society","lvl":2},{"id":"w73","w":"domestic","pos":"adj","tr":"домашний; внутренний","def":"relating to the home or own country","ex":"Domestic flights are cheaper.","topic":"economy","lvl":2},{"id":"w74","w":"dominant","pos":"adj","tr":"доминирующий","def":"most important or powerful","ex":"English is the dominant language of science.","topic":"society","lvl":2},{"id":"w75","w":"drastic","pos":"adj","tr":"радикальный","def":"extreme and sudden","ex":"Drastic measures were needed.","topic":"general","lvl":3},{"id":"w76","w":"dynamic","pos":"adj","tr":"динамичный","def":"full of energy and change","ex":"A dynamic and growing economy.","topic":"economy","lvl":2},{"id":"w77","w":"eliminate","pos":"v","tr":"устранять","def":"to remove completely","ex":"The aim is to eliminate poverty.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w78","w":"emerge","pos":"v","tr":"появляться","def":"to appear or become known","ex":"New problems emerged during the trial.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w79","w":"emphasise","pos":"v","tr":"подчёркивать","def":"to give special importance to","ex":"The teacher emphasised the need for practice.","topic":"academic","lvl":1},{"id":"w80","w":"enable","pos":"v","tr":"давать возможность","def":"to make something possible","ex":"Technology enables remote work.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w81","w":"encounter","pos":"v","tr":"сталкиваться","def":"to meet or experience unexpectedly","ex":"Students often encounter difficulties.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w82","w":"enhance","pos":"v","tr":"улучшать","def":"to improve the quality of something","ex":"Music can enhance concentration.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w83","w":"enormous","pos":"adj","tr":"огромный","def":"extremely large","ex":"The project required enormous effort.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w84","w":"ensure","pos":"v","tr":"гарантировать","def":"to make certain that something happens","ex":"Please ensure the door is locked.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w85","w":"entity","pos":"n","tr":"сущность","def":"a separate thing that exists","ex":"The company is a legal entity.","topic":"academic","lvl":3},{"id":"w86","w":"environment","pos":"n","tr":"окружающая среда","def":"the natural world or surroundings","ex":"We must protect the environment.","topic":"environment","lvl":1},{"id":"w87","w":"equivalent","pos":"adj","tr":"равноценный","def":"equal in value or meaning","ex":"One litre is roughly equivalent to 1.76 pints.","topic":"academic","lvl":2},{"id":"w88","w":"erode","pos":"v","tr":"разрушать, размывать","def":"to gradually wear away","ex":"The sea has eroded the coastline.","topic":"environment","lvl":3},{"id":"w89","w":"establish","pos":"v","tr":"основывать, устанавливать","def":"to set up or prove","ex":"The university was established in 1850.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w90","w":"estimate","pos":"v","tr":"оценивать приблизительно","def":"to guess the size or value","ex":"They estimate that 10,000 people attended.","topic":"academic","lvl":1},{"id":"w91","w":"evaluate","pos":"v","tr":"оценивать","def":"to judge the value or quality of","ex":"We need to evaluate the results.","topic":"academic","lvl":2},{"id":"w92","w":"eventually","pos":"adv","tr":"в конце концов","def":"after a long time","ex":"Eventually, she found a job.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w93","w":"evidence","pos":"n","tr":"доказательство","def":"facts that show something is true","ex":"There is no evidence of life on Mars.","topic":"academic","lvl":1},{"id":"w94","w":"evolve","pos":"v","tr":"развиваться, эволюционировать","def":"to develop gradually","ex":"Languages evolve over time.","topic":"science","lvl":2},{"id":"w95","w":"exaggerate","pos":"v","tr":"преувеличивать","def":"to make something seem larger or better","ex":"Don't exaggerate the problem.","topic":"general","lvl":3},{"id":"w96","w":"exceed","pos":"v","tr":"превышать","def":"to be greater than a limit","ex":"Speed must not exceed 50 km/h.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w97","w":"exclude","pos":"v","tr":"исключать","def":"to leave out or prevent from taking part","ex":"Children under five are excluded.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w98","w":"exhibit","pos":"v","tr":"демонстрировать, выставлять","def":"to show in public","ex":"The gallery exhibits modern sculpture.","topic":"culture","lvl":2},{"id":"w99","w":"expand","pos":"v","tr":"расширяться","def":"to become larger","ex":"The company plans to expand abroad.","topic":"economy","lvl":1},{"id":"w100","w":"exploit","pos":"v","tr":"использовать; эксплуатировать","def":"to use fully or unfairly","ex":"Companies exploit natural resources.","topic":"economy","lvl":3},{"id":"w101","w":"expose","pos":"v","tr":"подвергать воздействию; раскрывать","def":"to uncover or make vulnerable","ex":"Don't expose children to loud noise.","topic":"general","lvl":2},{"id":"w102","w":"facilitate","pos":"v","tr":"облегчать, содействовать","def":"to make easier","ex":"Software facilitates communication.","topic":"academic","lvl":3},{"id":"w103","w":"factor","pos":"n","tr":"фактор","def":"one thing that influences a result","ex":"Cost is an important factor.","topic":"general","lvl":1},{"id":"w104","w":"feasible","pos":"adj","tr":"осуществимый","def":"possible and practical","ex":"The plan is not financially feasible.","topic":"academic","lvl":3},{"id":"w105","w":"fluctuate","pos":"v","tr":"колебаться","def":"to change frequently","ex":